<title>USA: Eli Lilly and Co Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Eli Lilly and Co Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.68		    $0.57</p>
<p> Net			373,000		  311,300</p>
<p> Revs		   2,061,100		1,799,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 547,250		  546,337</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.78		    $2.30</p>
<p> Net		    1,523,500		1,306,600</p>
<p> Revs		   7,346,600		6,763,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 546,827		  569,026</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Discontinued operations gains of $31.3 million, or $0.06/shr, are excluded from 1995 Q4 net and shr, and of $984.3 million, or $1.73/shr, from 1995 net and shr.  </p>
<p>1996 Q4 EPS was in line with the First Call consensus estimate of $0.68 per share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
